    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Constitution, Intelligence, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.feats.Item.phbftMagicInitia]{Magic Initiate} (Wizard)</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> Arcana and History</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> Calligrapher’s Supplies</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.equipment.Item.phbwepQuartersta]{Quarterstaff}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.equipment.Item.phbtulCalligraph]{Calligrapher’s Supplies}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.equipment.Item.phbagBook0000000]{Book} (history), @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.equipment.Item.phbagParchment00]{Parchment} (8 sheets), @UUID[Compendium.dnd-players-handbook.equipment.Item.phbagRobe0000000]{Robe}, 8 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p><p>You spent your formative years traveling between manors and monasteries, performing various odd jobs and services in exchange for access to their libraries. You whiled away many a long evening studying books and scrolls, learning the lore of the multiverse—even the rudiments of magic—and your mind yearns for more.</p>",
      "chat": ""
    },
